Deprecated every composite action and reusable workflow except `deploy.yml`, in favour of the equivalents in [plone/meta](https://github.com/plone/meta) referenced at `@2.x`. The deprecated ones still run, but each now reports a warning annotation and a job summary note pointing at its replacement. `deploy.yml` is unaffected, since `plone/meta` has no Docker Swarm deployment counterpart. @ericof
